.TH SPACETRADER 6 "June 2026" "spacetrader" "Games"
.SH NAME
spacetrader \- terminal trading and survival game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B spacetrader
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B spacetrader
is an ncurses-based trading game set on an outlying colony world, Kepler's Reach.
Travel between locations, buy and sell goods, manage cargo, survive encounters,
and try to earn enough credits to get your starship out of the impound lot.
.PP
The game runs in a terminal and expects at least an 80x24 display.
.SH CONTROLS
.SS Title screen
.TP
.B N
Start a new game.
.TP
.B L
Load a saved game.
.TP
.B Q
Quit.
.SS Location view (main loop)
.TP
.B 1-4
Travel using numbered routes.
.TP
.B M / S / B / H / C / N / P / R / I / G / X / V / Q
Context-sensitive actions (market, store, bar, healing, notice board,
prospecting, rest, inventory, ground items, pay impound, save, quit).
.PP
Additional controls are shown in the command strip for each menu and encounter.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.spacetrader.sav
Primary save file.
.TP
.I ~/.spacetrader.sav.bak
Backup created when a save is unreadable, has a checksum failure, or version mismatch.
.TP
.I ~/.spacetrader.scores
Persistent high-score table.
.SH SCORING
Score entries are recorded on victory or death.
.PP
Current score formula:
.PP
.I score = credits + cargo_value + (turns * 10)
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Game exited normally.
